339	Condition & Eucl.\ Peak & Cos.\ Peak & Profile $r$ \\
340	\midrule
341	Trained image\_mean & L12 & L12 & 0.990 \\
342	Trained last\_preaction & L12 & L13 & 0.990 \\
343	Untrained image\_mean & L0 & L0 & 0.995 \\
344	Untrained last\_preaction & L1 & L1 & 0.992 \\
345	\bottomrule
